flowchart TD
    RESET[Reset or power-on] --> STAGE0[Stage-0 bootloader]
    STAGE0 --> META[Read redundant metadata]
    META --> SLOT[Select candidate slot]
    SLOT --> MANIFEST[Validate manifest]
    MANIFEST --> RANGE[Validate address and length]
    RANGE --> HASH[Compute SHA-512]
    HASH --> SIGNATURE[Verify Ed25519]
    SIGNATURE --> POLICY[Apply rollback and boot policy]
    POLICY --> VECTOR[Validate vector table]
    VECTOR --> APP[Start application]
    MANIFEST -->|Reject| SAFE[Fallback or safe halt]
    RANGE -->|Reject| SAFE
    HASH -->|Mismatch| SAFE
    SIGNATURE -->|Invalid| SAFE
    POLICY -->|Reject| SAFE
